
## Configuration

All scripts accept a `--url` parameter to specify the API base URL (default: `http://localhost:8000`).

You can also modify the `API_BASE_URL` constant in each script.

## API Endpoints Used

- `POST /clone` - Voice cloning
- `POST /tts` - Text-to-speech synthesis
- `GET /voices` - List voices
- `DELETE /voices/{voice_id}` - Delete voice

## Notes

1. For voice cloning, you need a reference audio file and its transcript
2. The `voice_id` for TTS is obtained from the cloning response or `/voices` endpoint
3. Streaming mode returns audio chunks in real-time
4. Download mode returns a complete audio file (base64 encoded or URL)
5. Studio mode prioritizes quality, fast mode prioritizes speed
